            "max_check_attempts": 5,
            "notes": "Checks the health status of all disks on a Huawei OceanStor Dorado storage system via the REST API (/disk endpoint). Alerts when any disk reports a non-normal health state or runs out of remaining service life, and optionally when its health score drops, when it has worn through most of its service life, or when it is running hot. Supports extended reporting via --lengthy.",
